				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4b7cf9e8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="4b7cf9e8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Northwest Shoals Community College Patriots field eight sports teams which include baseball, men and women&#8217;s cross country teams, women&#8217;s flag football, men and women&#8217;s golf teams, softball, and volleyball teams.</p>
<p>Athletic competition is an important part of the overall education of students, and NWSCC is committed to provide that opportunity to our community and area high school student athletes. </p>

<p class="wp-block-paragraph">NWSCC is currently a member of the <a href="http://www.acccathletics.com/landing/index" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Alabama Community College Conference (ACCC)</a> and will compete against various opponents within the ACCC, <a href="http://www.njcaa.org/landing/index" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">National Junior College Athletic Association (NJCAA)</a> and the <a href="https://www.ncaa.com/">National Collegiate Athletic Association (NCAA)</a>.</p>
								</div>
				</div>
